Third-party projects referenced
-------------------------------

Nothing from any project below is bundled in, linked against, or redistributed
by this crate. It is named because the crate documentation compares itself to it.

* SPARK, SPARK Pro and gnatprove -- AdaCore. The workflow this crate is modelled
  on. This crate is an independent experiment and is not affiliated with,
  sponsored by, or supported by AdaCore.
* rustc_public / `rustc-dev` -- the Rust project. Named because the parent
  crate's MIR frontend is cross-checked against `rustc_public` in CI. Used only
  by that oracle, which is a separate, unpublished tool; not a dependency of
  this crate or of the parent.

The crate itself depends on nothing at all. Its default build links `core` and
nothing else, which the parent repository's gate 5 enforces.
